      "created_at": "2018-07-23T16:45:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Paul\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/48/5862_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Paul:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/rysmith6\">@RySmith6</a> I'd recommend bringing a copy. I will definitely be able to show up at some point during or after the game to distribute prizes, but I can't guarantee that I'll be able to hit a specific delivery time slot <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Done and done. Now to play the \"Will I have to check a bag for the games I'm bringing?\" game. It's a real-space resource management game with a minor push-your-luck component.</p>",
