      "created_at": "2018-07-24T01:35:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Make sure to check my slight rules and balance modification notes if it’s of any interest. you don’t want a Wrath player get clever and break the game!&nbsp;</p><p>For all it’s addmited problems, I still enjoy GSF for what it is. It just needs that little push to be that engaging puzzle GSF becomes.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>remember to keep your decks lean and mean. Enjoy saving the universe.&nbsp;</p>",
